    "active": true,
    "description": "<p>You try to create illusory terrors in others' minds. Each creature of your choice in a 30-foot-radius Sphere centered on a point within range makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failed save, a target takes 10d10 Psychic damage and has the Frightened condition for the duration. On a successful save, a target takes half as much damage only.</p><p>A Frightened target makes a Wisdom saving throw at the end of each of its turns. On a failed save, it takes 10d10 Psychic damage. On a successful save, the spell ends on that target.</p>",
